     "2. Materials and Experimental Methods",
     "2.1. Materials and Experiment Setup",
     "The material used in this study was the second-generation nickel-based superalloy",
     "DD6, and all materials were obtained from Beijing Institute of Aeronautical Materials in",
     "China. DD6 is widely employed in turbine working blades and guide vanes due to its",
     "outstanding overall performance. The elemental composition of DD6 is shown in Table 1.",
     "Table 1. Elementary composition (wt%) of single-crystal alloy DD6.",
